<title>POLAND: KPBP-BICK AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>KPBP-BICK AUG NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.21 vs   0.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.32 vs   0.27</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.32 vs   0.14</p>
<p> Sales		    6.75 vs   4.13</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.54 vs   1.12</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.61 vs   2.04</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.09 vs   2.04</p>
<p> Sales		   46.44 vs  33.16</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>KPBP-Bick SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
